    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομαγ-δᾰλία</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομαγ-λά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the crumb</i> or <i>inside of the loaf,</i> on which the
